This module is the terminal-emulator and terminal-view libraries from Termux
(https://github.com/termux/termux-app, tag v0.118.3), which come from Terminal
Emulator for Android by Jack Palevich. They are released under the Apache
License 2.0: https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

Whelk changes TerminalSession so a session can run over a stream (SSH, Telnet)
as well as a local pty, and changes the view where noted in the code.
